[
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "We went to a reunion last Sunday, and it was really nice to catch up."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fenette",
    "text": "How's your week going? Still recovering from the weekend?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "Pretty good! I took it slow and got some errands done."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fenette",
    "text": "That sounds nice. I mostly stayed in and relaxed."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "Honestly, that sounds perfect. I could use a quiet weekend too."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fenette",
    "text": "Same, though I did get outside for a bit. It felt good to get some fresh air."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "Nice! I barely made it out, but I did catch up on a few things."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fenette",
    "text": "I went to a hackathon last Saturday, and it was a fun change of pace."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "Oh, that sounds fun! Was it a long day?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fenette",
    "text": "Yeah, pretty full-on, but I learned a lot and enjoyed it."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ashelle",
    "text": "Glad it was worth it! Hope you're having a mellow afternoon now."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "My cat's name is Galy, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "Been playing that game again. The levels are way harder than I remembered."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "Same, I keep getting distracted trying to find every hidden item."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "The soundtrack is so good, though. I could leave it on for hours."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "I went to a workshop yesterday, and it was actually pretty fun."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "Nice! I might play a bit before breakfast. Just one level, probably."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "I keep saying that and then suddenly it's been two hours."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "The new update made the controls feel a lot smoother for me."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "Oh, I haven't tried it yet. Maybe I'll give it a go later."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "You should! The opening stage feels much less clunky now."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novisa",
    "text": "That sounds promising. I was getting stuck on the same jump every time."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Fius",
    "text": "I know that one. Took me a bunch of tries, but it feels great when you land it."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Ishelle",
    "text": "Are you still thinking of heading out soon? I should probably start packing, even though it's way too late to be awake 😅"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novashena",
    "text": "Same, I keep checking my bag and somehow it still feels like I forgot something. What are you bringing for the ride?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ishelle",
    "text": "Random fact: Deljunorn's favorite food is dumplings."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novashena",
    "text": "I'm trying to keep my bag light, but I always overpack. Maybe I'll leave a little room for snacks."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ishelle",
    "text": "Oh, Baith is my friend, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novashena",
    "text": "I still need to sort out what to wear for the journey. I might just go with something comfy."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ishelle",
    "text": "That sounds like the right move. I want to bring a book, but I don't want my bag to get too heavy."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novashena",
    "text": "Maybe I'll download something to read before we leave. I always mean to do that and forget."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ishelle",
    "text": "I'll make a little list so I don't leave anything behind. Hopefully I can actually get some sleep first 😅"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Novashena",
    "text": "I just realized I never told you: my cat's name is Tavsy."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "How’s the move coming along? Bet it feels good to have the boxes out of the hallway."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "Slowly getting there 😅 I’ve unpacked the kitchen, at least."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "That’s a solid start. Are you settling into the new place okay?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "Yeah, it’s starting to feel like home. Novette plays the flute, and the little tune earlier made unpacking nicer."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "Aw, that sounds lovely. Have you figured out where everything’s going yet?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "I went to a festival last Wednesday, and it was such a nice break from all the moving stuff."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "You deserved a breather! Is your bedroom mostly sorted now?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "Almost. I just need to get the shelves in place and find the sheets."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "Once the bed’s set up, it’ll feel way more settled."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "For sure. I’m already liking how bright the room is in the morning."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "Nice! Have you found a good spot for all your books?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "Not yet, they’re still in a couple of boxes. I’ll sort them once the living room’s clear."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tiryaelle",
    "text": "Sounds like a plan. Hope the last few bits come together easily."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Taald",
    "text": "Thanks! I play the ukulele, so I’m saving a cozy corner for it."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "Have you seen the news tonight? Feels like every update is another thing to catch up on."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "Yeah, I skimmed a few headlines. Hard to keep up when they keep coming."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "Same, I keep checking and then wishing I hadn't. Anything actually good in the headlines?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "Random thing: my cat Bapip has decided the keyboard is the best place to nap."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "I haven't found much good news yet. Maybe the morning headlines will be lighter."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "Hope so. I need a break from all the serious updates."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "Totally. I opened the news for a minute and somehow kept scrolling."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "I work for Viven Foods, and I still catch myself thinking about work at this hour."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "This late-night news habit is not helping me switch off."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "Same here. Might be time to put the phone down and let the headlines wait."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "Good call. The updates can wait until we're properly awake."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Junen",
    "text": "Agreed. I'm going to stop scrolling and try to get some sleep."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Loir",
    "text": "Gala's favourite colour is turquoise."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "I’m allergic to pollen, so spring always gets me."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "This new phone is so smooth so far. The screen feels huge."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "Nice, what’s the battery like? Mine is hanging on by a thread."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "Pretty solid actually, I’ve been scrolling forever and it’s still full."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "That’s impressive. I love how fast new phones feel."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "Yeah, and the camera looks sharp even in low light."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "My favourite colour is navy blue, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "I bet it takes great photos too. Have you tried it yet?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "Drair plays piano, and they make it sound effortless."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "The settings on this phone are easy to navigate."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "I went to a workshop last Saturday, and it was a nice change of pace."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ulan",
    "text": "This phone has a focus mode I might actually use."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Temloisa",
    "text": "The battery saver is handy too. I’m still figuring out all the little features."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Nubelelle",
    "text": "I live in Ulfiport, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Kawyn",
    "text": "How’s your new phone treating you?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nubelelle",
    "text": "I work at Netem Clinic."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Kawyn",
    "text": "The new phone’s camera looks so sharp."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nubelelle",
    "text": "I’m still getting used to the new phone, but I like it."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Kawyn",
    "text": "The battery on my new phone lasts ages."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nubelelle",
    "text": "I grew up in Fihamere."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Kawyn",
    "text": "Have you tried the night mode on your new phone?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nubelelle",
    "text": "Yep, the new phone takes great photos indoors too."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Kawyn",
    "text": "Holen’s dog is named Visy."
  }
]
